      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I had the same issue with text mesh pro.\nIt appears the package manager is not being called reliably upon package import when one or both dependencies are missing.\n```\nassets/VRCSDK/Dependencies/VRChat/Scripts/Validation/WorldValidation/UnityEventFilter.cs(7,7): error CS0246: The type or namespace name 'TMPro' could not be found (are you missing a using directive or an assembly reference?)\n```\nIt seems for me Cinemachine was triggered to install, but not TMPro.\nEdit: Maybe TMPro was just not accounted for.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
